    description: Some("A vertical platformer in the Doodle Jump mould: you steer an amoeba ever upward across an endless column of platforms — steady yellow, vanishing white and sliding blue — without falling back off the bottom. The screen wraps side to side, and collecting bacteria that spell out A-M-O-E-B-A earns super-boosts."),
